<p>When you deactivate Vaporous Step, if the psychoport succeeds you inhale some of the vapours, regenerating <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5, 15, 22, 29, 35</acronym> steam and <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">183, 239, 283, 320, 353</acronym> life.</p><p>The effects will be multiplied by 33% (diminutive) for each charge of Vaporous Step.</p><p>The healing done will increase with your Mindpower.</p>